# Strict Rule: Never commit populated secrets to Git.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. SUPABASE (PostgreSQL + Auth + Storage)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client-side safe variables (Anon key with Row Level Security enabled)
